concept:australian-border-force-amendment-protected-information-act-2017-sch-1-sec-5 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "5 At the end of section 4"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-5 ;
    values:originalText "Add:  (5) Without limiting the definition of Immigration and Border Protection information in subsection (1), the following kinds of information are taken to be information the disclosure of which would or could reasonably be expected to prejudice the security, defence or international relations of Australia:  (a) information that has a security classification;  (b) information that has originated with, or been received from, an intelligence agency.  (6) Without limiting the definition of Immigration and Border Protection information in subsection (1), information that was provided to the Commonwealth pursuant to a statutory obligation or otherwise by compulsion of law is taken to be information the disclosure of which would or could reasonably be expected to found an action by a person (other than the Commonwealth) for breach of a duty of confidence.  Schedule 1  Amendments" ;
    skos:definition "Add:  (5) Without limiting the definition of Immigration and Border Protection information in subsection (1), the following kinds of information are taken to be information the disclosure of which would or could reasonably be expected to prejudice the security, defence or international relations of Australia:  (a) information that has a security classification;  (b) information that has originated with, or been received from, an intelligence agency.  (6) Without limiting the definition of Immigration and Border Protection information in subsection (1), information that was provided to the Commonwealth pursuant to a statutory obligation or otherwise by compulsion of law is taken to be information the disclosure of which would or could reasonably be expected to found an action by a person (other than the Commonwealth) for breach of a duty of confidence.  Schedule 1  Amendments"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "f552a1e79bdc74d313b3f0f000e309faa363c9b81f8db6b9d0fb2b41f0dcea48" ;
    cof:pageNumber "9"^^xsd:integer ;
